  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed first-floor rear extension, by reason of its excessive depth and siting on the common boundary, would create an overly dominant form of development that would result in an unacceptable loss of outlook, sunlight and daylight as perceived by No.67 Manor Road, and would result in an unacceptably heightened sense of enclosure. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010) and Policies DMD 8, DMD11 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
